# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data — the 5.63 GB connectome is NEVER committed.
# Obtain your own copy of MaleCNS v1.0 (CC-BY) and point FLYBRAIN_DATA_DIR at it.
# Small derived JSON summaries (stats, connectivity_facts, neuropil_stats) ARE
# committed as auditable evidence; the raw feather / npy payloads stay local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
male_cns/*.feather
male_cns/*.progress.json
male_cns/connectome_cache/
male_cns/flat-connectome/
drosophila_connectome/data/
drosophila_connectome/dataset/
# Raw third-party connectome downloads for the extraction scripts
# (cel_data/ = WormWiring xlsx, larva_data/ = fly_larva csv.zip,
# zebrafish_data/ = Petkova 2025 TEN/HMI, CC-BY-NC 4.0).
# The derived JSON they produce IS committed (cel_profiles.json /
# larva_profiles.json / zebrafish_profiles.json); the downloads
# themselves are not — CC-BY-NC source data stays out of this MIT tree.
cel_data/
larva_data/
zebrafish_data/
.backups/
archive/
ops/
tmp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — the live service config carries a real API key. Never commit it.
# Ship config.example.json instead; copy to config.json and set your own key.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
flybrain-connectome-mcp/mcp_connectome/config.json
config.local.json
*.local.json

