# Anti-plagiarism Tier 2/3: closed-tier data (per LICENSE-CLAUSE.md)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw worm connectome zips (Cook 2019, Emmons Lab mirror) — source data,
# not redistributed under MIT. Fetch with curl from networks.skewed.de.
data/worm/raw/*.zip

# Local snapshots of the private Tier-2 repo
# (lm203688/flybrain-connectome-core) — closed-tier data that must never
# land in this MIT tree. Local checkouts may live either as a sibling of the
# public repo (conventional layout) or inside the repo tree (this machine).
flybrain-tier2-backup-*/
flybrain-connectome-core/

